---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="🔮 Kvant & 3D Matematik Laboratoriya — 4D Tesserakt, Xaos & Fraktallar | Oliy Matematika" 
  description="Matematikaning eng hayratlanarli cho'qqilari: 4D Giperkub (Tesserakt) aylanishi, Lorenz kapalak xaos attraktori, GPU cheksiz fraktal zumi, koinot gravitatsiya sandboxi va 3Blue1Brown fazo simulyatsiyalari."
>
  <div class="lab-container">
    <!-- Lab Hero Banner -->
    <header class="lab-hero">
      <div class="lab-badge">
        <span class="badge-icon">⚡</span>
        <span>WebGL 3D & Kvant Laboratoriya</span>
        <span class="badge-pill">60 FPS WebGL & GPU</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="lab-title">Interaktiv 3D & Kvant Matematika Laboratoriyasi</h1>
      <p class="lab-subtitle">
        Matematika faqat qog'ozdagi formulalar emas — bu koinotning eng go'zal arxitekturasi! 
        Bu yerda siz <strong>4-o'lchamli fazoni</strong> ko'rasiz, <strong>xaos nazariyasining kapalak effekti</strong>ni boshqarasiz, 
        <strong>cheksiz fraktallar olamiga</strong> sho'ng'iysiz va <strong>koinot gravitatsiyasini</strong> o'z qo'lingiz bilan yaratasiz.
      </p>

      <!-- Navigation Tabs (Grouped into Flagship 3D/Cosmos and Analytical Labs) -->
      <div class="lab-tabs-header">
        <span class="tabs-category-label">🌟 Flagman 3D & Koinot Simulyatsiyalari:</span>
      </div>
      <div class="lab-tabs" role="tablist">
        <button class="lab-tab active" data-tab="tesseract">
          <span class="tab-icon">🌌</span>
          <div class="tab-text">
            <strong>4D Tesserakt</strong>
            <small>4-O'lchamli Giperkub</small>
          </div>
        </button>
        <button class="lab-tab" data-tab="lorenz">
          <span class="tab-icon">🦋</span>
          <div class="tab-text">
            <strong>Lorenz 3D Xaos</strong>
            <small>Kapalak effekti</small>
          </div>
        </button>
        <button class="lab-tab" data-tab="fractal">
          <span class="tab-icon">🌀</span>
          <div class="tab-text">
            <strong>GPU Fraktal Zumi</strong>
            <small>Mandelbrot & Yuliya</small>
          </div>
        </button>
        <button class="lab-tab" data-tab="gravity">
          <span class="tab-icon">🪐</span>
          <div class="tab-text">
            <strong>Koinot Gravitatsiyasi</strong>
            <small>N-Jism Sandboxi</small>
          </div>
        </button>
      </div>

      <div class="lab-tabs-header" style="margin-top: 0.75rem;">
        <span class="tabs-category-label">📐 Klassik Tahlil & Algebra Laboratoriyasi:</span>
      </div>
      <div class="lab-tabs" role="tablist">
        <button class="lab-tab" data-tab="matrix-warp">
          <span class="tab-icon">📐</span>
          <div class="tab-text">
            <strong>Fazo Transformatori</strong>
            <small>3Blue1Brown uslubi</small>
          </div>
        </button>
        <button class="lab-tab" data-tab="riemann-sum">
          <span class="tab-icon">⚡</span>
          <div class="tab-text">
            <strong>Riman Integrali</strong>
            <small>Maydon slayderi</small>
          </div>
        </button>
        <button class="lab-tab" data-tab="monte-carlo">
          <span class="tab-icon">🎯</span>
          <div class="tab-text">
            <strong>Monte-Karlo π</strong>
            <small>Ehtimollik yog'dusi</small>
          </div>
        </button>
        <button class="lab-tab" data-tab="fourier-epicycles">
          <span class="tab-icon">🌊</span>
          <div class="tab-text">
            <strong>Fure Epitsikllari</strong>
            <small>Aylanalar to'lqini</small>
          </div>
        </button>
        <button class="lab-tab" data-tab="galton-board">
          <span class="tab-icon">🔮</span>
          <div class="tab-text">
            <strong>Galton Doskasi</strong>
            <small>Normal taqsimot</small>
          </div>
        </button>
        <button class="lab-tab" data-tab="gradient-descent">
          <span class="tab-icon">🏔️</span>
          <div class="tab-text">
            <strong>Gradient Tushishi</strong>
            <small>AI qanday o'rganadi?</small>
          </div>
        </button>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- ================= 1. 4D TESSERACT HYPERCUBE ================= -->
    <section id="panel-tesseract" class="sim-panel active">
      <div class="sim-grid">
        <div class="canvas-card">
          <div class="canvas-header">
            <h3>🌌 4-O'lchamli Fazo: Tesserakt (4D Giperkub)</h3>
            <span class="live-tag live-3d">WebGL 3D Proyeksiya</span>
          </div>
          <div class="canvas-wrapper canvas-3d-wrapper">
            <canvas id="tesseract-canvas" width="600" height="520"></canvas>
            <div class="canvas-overlay-hint">
              <span>🖱️ Sichqoncha bilan 3D fazoda 360° aylantiring</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="canvas-legend">
            <span><strong style="color: #38bdf8;">● 16 ta 4D cho'qqi</strong> (±1, ±1, ±1, ±1)</span>
            <span><strong style="color: #ec4899;">— 32 ta 4D qirra</strong></span>
            <span><strong style="color: #a855f7;">■ 8 ta kubik katak (3D fazodagi soya)</strong></span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="controls-card">
          <div class="panel-section">
            <h4>4-O'lchamli Aylanish Samolyotlari:</h4>
            <div class="slider-group">
              <label class="control-label">
                <span>XW tekisligida aylanish:</span>
                <strong id="tess-xw-val">0.015</strong>
              </label>
              <input type="range" id="tess-xw-slider" min="-0.05" max="0.05" step="0.002" value="0.015" />
            </div>
            <div class="slider-group">
              <label class="control-label">
                <span>YW tekisligida aylanish:</span>
                <strong id="tess-yw-val">0.010</strong>
              </label>
              <input type="range" id="tess-yw-slider" min="-0.05" max="0.05" step="0.002" value="0.010" />
            </div>
            <div class="slider-group">
              <label class="control-label">
                <span>ZW tekisligida aylanish:</span>
                <strong id="tess-zw-val">0.005</strong>
              </label>
              <input type="range" id="tess-zw-slider" min="-0.05" max="0.05" step="0.002" value="0.005" />
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="panel-section">
            <label class="control-label">
              <span>4D Kamera Masofasi (w₀ chuqurlik):</span>
              <strong id="tess-dist-val">2.2</strong>
            </label>
            <input type="range" id="tess-dist-slider" min="1.4" max="4.0" step="0.1" value="2.2" />
          </div>

          <div class="panel-section">
            <h4>Tayyor 4D Effektlar:</h4>
            <div class="presets-wrap">
              <button class="preset-pill active" data-tess-preset="inside-out">Ichma-ich O'sish (XW)</button>
              <button class="preset-pill" data-tess-preset="double-rot">Qo'shaloq 4D Aylanish</button>
              <button class="preset-pill" data-tess-preset="full-chaos">To'liq 4D Xoreografiya</button>
              <button class="preset-pill" data-tess-preset="static-cube">Tinch holat</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="metrics-box">
            <div class="metric-row">
              <span>Fazoviy o'lcham:</span>
              <strong>4 o'lcham (X, Y, Z, W)</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-row">
              <span>Cho'qqilar / Qirralar / Yoqlar:</span>
              <strong>16 / 32 / 24</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-row">
              <span>Hajm (Giperhajm):</span>
              <strong>V₄ = a⁴ = 16 birlik⁴</strong>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="theory-card">
        <h4>💡 Nima uchun kub o'zining ichidan o'zi o'sib chiqmoqda?</h4>
        <p>
          Inson ko'zi to'rtinchi fazoviy o'qni ($W$) to'g'ridan-to'g'ri ko'ra olmaydi. 
          Xuddi 3D kubning qog'ozdagi soyasi (2D parallelogramm) harakatlanganda qisqarib-kengaygandek tuyulgani kabi, 
          4D Tesserakt to'rtinchi o'lchamda aylanganda, uning bizning 3D olamimizga tushayotgan <strong>uch o'lchamli soyasi</strong> 
          ichki kubdan tashqi kubga aylanib, o'zining ichidan o'zi teskari o'sib chiqayotgandek ko'rinadi!
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ================= 2. LORENZ 3D CHAOS ATTRACTOR ================= -->
    <section id="panel-lorenz" class="sim-panel">
      <div class="sim-grid">
        <div class="canvas-card">
          <div class="canvas-header">
            <h3>🦋 Lorenz 3D Attraktori: Xaos va «Kapalak Effekti»</h3>
            <span class="live-tag live-3d">30 000+ Neon Zarracha</span>
          </div>
          <div class="canvas-wrapper canvas-3d-wrapper">
            <canvas id="lorenz-canvas" width="600" height="520"></canvas>
            <div class="canvas-overlay-hint">
              <span>🖱️ Sichqoncha bilan 360° orbital kamerani aylantiring</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="canvas-legend">
            <span><strong style="color: #06b6d4;">— 1-Qanot:</strong> Chap aylanma oqim</span>
            <span><strong style="color: #ec4899;">— 2-Qanot:</strong> O'ng aylanma oqim</span>
            <span><strong style="color: #f59e0b;">● Markaz:</strong> Beqaror egar nuqta</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="controls-card">
          <div class="panel-section">
            <h4>Xaos Differensial Tenglama Parametrlari:</h4>
            <div class="slider-group">
              <label class="control-label">
                <span>Reyli soni ρ (Konvektsiya kuchi):</span>
                <strong id="lorenz-rho-val">28</strong>
              </label>
              <input type="range" id="lorenz-rho-slider" min="10" max="60" step="0.5" value="28" />
            </div>
            <div class="slider-group">
              <label class="control-label">
                <span>Prandtl soni σ (Yopishqoqlik):</span>
                <strong id="lorenz-sigma-val">10</strong>
              </label>
              <input type="range" id="lorenz-sigma-slider" min="2" max="25" step="0.5" value="10" />
            </div>
            <div class="slider-group">
              <label class="control-label">
                <span>Geometriya parametri β:</span>
                <strong id="lorenz-beta-val">2.67</strong>
              </label>
              <input type="range" id="lorenz-beta-slider" min="0.5" max="5.0" step="0.1" value="2.67" />
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="panel-section">
            <h4>Attraktor Namunalarini Tanlang:</h4>
            <div class="presets-wrap">
              <button class="preset-pill active" data-lorenz-preset="classic">Klassik Kapalak (ρ = 28)</button>
              <button class="preset-pill" data-lorenz-preset="turbulent">Yuqori Turbulentlik (ρ = 48)</button>
              <button class="preset-pill" data-lorenz-preset="limit-cycle">Barqaror Tsikl (ρ = 14)</button>
              <button class="preset-pill" data-lorenz-preset="reset-particles">Zarrachalarni portlatish</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="metrics-box">
            <div class="metric-row">
              <span>Zarrachalar soni:</span>
              <strong>30 000 ta faol kvant</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-row">
              <span>Fraktal o'lchami:</span>
              <strong>D ≈ 2.06 (Fraktal fazo)</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-row">
              <span>Holat:</span>
              <span id="lorenz-status" style="color: #ec4899; font-weight: 700;">Deterministik Xaos</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="theory-card">
        <h4>💡 Edvard Lorenz va Kapalak effekti:</h4>
        <p>
          Lorenz ob-havo modelini o'rganayotganda kashf qilgan: bir-biridan 0.000001 farq qiladigan ikkita boshlang'ich nuqta 
          bir necha qadamdan so'ng mutlaqo boshqa-boshqa qanotlarga uchib ketadi! 
          Bu <strong>«Braziliyadagi kapalak qanot qoqishi Texasda to'fon keltirib chiqarishi mumkin»</strong> degan mashhur xaos tamoyilining matematik ifodasidir:
          dx/dt = σ(y - x), dy/dt = x(ρ - z) - y, dz/dt = xy - βz.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ================= 3. GPU FRACTAL DEEP ZOOM ================= -->
    <section id="panel-fractal" class="sim-panel">
      <div class="sim-grid">
        <div class="canvas-card">
          <div class="canvas-header">
            <h3>🌀 Mandelbrot & Yuliya: GPU Cheksiz Fraktal Zumi</h3>
            <span class="live-tag live-3d">WebGL 2.0 Pixel Shader</span>
          </div>
          <div class="canvas-wrapper" style="position: relative;">
            <canvas id="fractal-canvas" width="600" height="520"></canvas>
            <div class="fractal-hud">
              <span>Zum darajasi: <strong id="fractal-zoom-display">1.0×</strong></span>
              <span>Koordinata: <strong id="fractal-coords-display">(-0.7, 0.0)</strong></span>
            </div>
            <div class="canvas-overlay-hint">
              <span>🖱️ Sichqoncha g'ildiragi orqali cheksiz ichkariga kiring va suring</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="canvas-legend">
            <span><strong style="color: #f59e0b;">Z_(n+1) = Z_n² + C</strong></span>
            <span>Cheksizlik chegarasidagi fraktal qirg'oqlar</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="controls-card">
          <div class="panel-section">
            <div style="display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
              <button id="btn-fractal-autozoom" class="btn btn-primary" style="flex: 1;">🚀 Avto-Zum (Kino rejimi)</button>
              <button id="btn-fractal-zoomin" class="btn btn-secondary" title="Yaqinlashtirish">➕ Zum</button>
              <button id="btn-fractal-zoomout" class="btn btn-secondary" title="Uzoqlashtirish">➖ Uzoq</button>
              <button id="btn-fractal-reset" class="btn btn-secondary">Boshlang'ich</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="panel-section">
            <h4>Fraktal Rejimi:</h4>
            <div class="presets-wrap">
              <button class="preset-pill active" data-fractal-mode="mandelbrot">Mandelbrot To'plami</button>
              <button class="preset-pill" data-fractal-mode="julia1">Yuliya: Ajdaho (c = -0.7 + 0.27i)</button>
              <button class="preset-pill" data-fractal-mode="julia2">Yuliya: Dendrit (c = -0.4 + 0.6i)</button>
              <button class="preset-pill" data-fractal-mode="julia3">Yuliya: Galaktika (c = -0.8 + 0.15i)</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="panel-section">
            <h4>Rang Palitrasi (GPU Shader):</h4>
            <div class="presets-wrap">
              <button class="preset-pill active" data-palette="cyberpunk">🟣 Kiberpank Neon</button>
              <button class="preset-pill" data-palette="fire">🔥 Olovli Quyosh</button>
              <button class="preset-pill" data-palette="ocean">🌊 Moviy Okean</button>
              <button class="preset-pill" data-palette="rainbow">🌈 Kamalak Spektr</button>
              <button class="preset-pill" data-palette="emerald">⚡ Zangori Kvant</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="panel-section">
            <label class="control-label">
              <span>Iteratsiyalar soni (Tafsilot chuqurligi):</span>
              <strong id="fractal-iter-val">120</strong>
            </label>
            <input type="range" id="fractal-iter-slider" min="30" max="350" step="10" value="120" />
          </div>

          <div class="metrics-box">
            <div class="metric-row">
              <span>GPU piksellar hisobi:</span>
              <strong>Real vaqtda 300 000+ nur/kadr</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-row">
              <span>Matematik chegara:</span>
              <strong>|Z| &le; 2 (Yaqinlashish sohasi)</strong>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="theory-card">
        <h4>💡 Benua Mandelbrotning cheksiz geometriyasi:</h4>
        <p>
          Mandelbrot to'plami — insoniyat tarixida yaratilgan eng murakkab matematik shakl. 
          Siz qanchalik chuqur yaqinlashsangiz ham (hatto bir milliard martagacha zum qilsangiz ham), 
          har safar butunlay yangi spiralsimon qasrlar, to'rlar va asosiy shaklning kichik nusxalari (o'xshashlik) cheksiz tug'ilaveradi!
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ================= 4. COSMIC GRAVITY & N-BODY SANDBOX ================= -->
    <section id="panel-gravity" class="sim-panel">
      <div class="sim-grid">
        <div class="canvas-card">
          <div class="canvas-header">
            <h3>🪐 Koinot Gravitatsiyasi: N-Jism va Sayyoralar Sandboxi</h3>
            <span class="live-tag">Nyuton & Eynshteyn Fizikasi</span>
          </div>
          <div class="canvas-wrapper" style="position: relative;">
            <canvas id="gravity-canvas" width="600" height="520"></canvas>
            <div class="canvas-overlay-hint">
              <span>👆 Bo'sh fazoga sichqoncha bilan bosib, tortib otib yuboring (slingshot)!</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="canvas-legend">
            <span><strong style="color: #fbbf24;">● Quyosh</strong> (Og'ir yulduz)</span>
            <span><strong style="color: #38bdf8;">● Sayyoralar</strong> (Orbita izlari)</span>
            <span><strong style="color: #ef4444;">💥 To'qnashuv:</strong> Birlashish va zarba to'lqini</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="controls-card">
          <div class="panel-section">
            <h4>Yangi Jism Turini Tanlang:</h4>
            <div class="presets-wrap">
              <button class="preset-pill active" data-spawn-type="planet">🪐 Sayyora (M = 100)</button>
              <button class="preset-pill" data-spawn-type="sun">🌟 Quyosh (M = 8000)</button>
              <button class="preset-pill danger-pill" data-spawn-type="blackhole">🕳️ Qora Tuynuk (M = 30000)</button>
              <button class="preset-pill" data-spawn-type="moon">🌑 Yo'ldosh (M = 15)</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="panel-section">
            <h4>Mashhur Tayyor Koinot Tizimlari:</h4>
            <div class="presets-wrap">
              <button class="preset-pill active" data-grav-preset="solar">☀️ Barqaror Quyosh Tizimi</button>
              <button class="preset-pill" data-grav-preset="figure8">♾️ Mashhur Figure-8 (3-jism)</button>
              <button class="preset-pill" data-grav-preset="binary">⚔️ Ikkitalik Yulduz (Binary)</button>
              <button class="preset-pill" data-grav-preset="chaos">🌌 Xaotik To'qnashuv (+30 jism)</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="panel-section">
            <div style="display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
              <button id="btn-grav-pause" class="btn btn-secondary" style="flex: 1;">⏸️ Pauza</button>
              <button id="btn-grav-clear" class="btn btn-secondary">Tozalash</button>
              <button id="btn-grav-trails" class="btn btn-secondary">Orbita Izlari: On</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="panel-section">
            <label class="control-label">
              <span>Gravitatsiya doimiysi (G kuchi):</span>
              <strong id="grav-g-val">1.0</strong>
            </label>
            <input type="range" id="grav-g-slider" min="0.2" max="3.0" step="0.1" value="1.0" />
          </div>

          <div class="metrics-box">
            <div class="metric-row">
              <span>Jami jismlar soni:</span>
              <strong id="grav-body-count">5</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-row">
              <span>Tizim energiyasi (E):</span>
              <strong id="grav-energy" style="color: #10b981;">Saqlanmoqda</strong>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="theory-card">
        <h4>💡 N-Jism Masalasi va Gravitatsiya siri:</h4>
        <p>
          Ikkita jism harakati (Quyosh va Yer) Kepler qonunlari bo'yicha aniq analitik yechimga ega. 
          Biroq uchinchi jism (Oy yoki boshqa sayyora) qo'shilishi bilanoq tizim <strong>«N-jism muammosi»</strong>ga aylanadi — 
          unga umumiy yopiq formula yo'q! Orbitadagi har bir jism barcha boshqa jismlarni 
          F = G · (m₁ · m₂) / r² qonuni bilan tortadi va faqat sonli differensial integrallash orqali hisoblanadi.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ================= 5. MATRIX WARP SIMULATOR ================= -->
    <section id="panel-matrix-warp" class="sim-panel">
      <div class="sim-grid">
        <div class="canvas-card">
          <div class="canvas-header">
            <h3>📐 2D Fazo Transformatsiyasi va Determinant</h3>
            <span class="live-tag">3Blue1Brown Uslubi</span>
          </div>
          <div class="canvas-wrapper">
            <canvas id="matrix-canvas" width="600" height="500"></canvas>
          </div>
          <div class="canvas-legend">
            <span><strong style="color: #ef4444;">— î</strong> (1, 0) yangi o'rni</span>
            <span><strong style="color: #10b981;">— ĵ</strong> (0, 1) yangi o'rni</span>
            <span><strong style="color: #3b82f6;">■ Parallelogramm:</strong> Determinant</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="controls-card">
          <div class="panel-section">
            <h4>Matritsa elementlari: A = [[a, b], [c, d]]</h4>
            <div class="matrix-inputs-grid">
              <div class="input-field">
                <label>a (î.x):</label>
                <input type="number" id="mat-a" value="1" step="0.5" />
              </div>
              <div class="input-field">
                <label>b (ĵ.x):</label>
                <input type="number" id="mat-b" value="1" step="0.5" />
              </div>
              <div class="input-field">
                <label>c (î.y):</label>
                <input type="number" id="mat-c" value="0" step="0.5" />
              </div>
              <div class="input-field">
                <label>d (ĵ.y):</label>
                <input type="number" id="mat-d" value="1" step="0.5" />
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="panel-section">
