            <div style="display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; margin-top: 0.5rem;">
              <button id="btn-animate-matrix" class="btn btn-primary" style="flex: 1;">▶ Qayta animatsiya</button>
              <button id="btn-reset-matrix" class="btn btn-secondary">Boshlang'ich</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="panel-section">
            <h4>Mashhur Tayyor Namunalar (Presets):</h4>
            <div class="presets-wrap">
              <button class="preset-pill" data-preset="shear">Siljish (Shear)</button>
              <button class="preset-pill" data-preset="rotate45">Burish 45°</button>
              <button class="preset-pill" data-preset="rotate90">Burish 90°</button>
              <button class="preset-pill" data-preset="scale2">2x Cho'zish</button>
              <button class="preset-pill" data-preset="reflect">Akslantirish (X)</button>
              <button class="preset-pill danger-pill" data-preset="squash">Yassilash (det = 0)</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="metrics-box">
            <div class="metric-row">
              <span>Determinant det(A):</span>
              <strong id="mat-det-display">1</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-row">
              <span>Geometrik ma'no:</span>
              <span id="mat-status-display" style="color: #10b981; font-weight: 600;">Yuz saqlanadi</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="theory-card">
        <h4>💡 Nima sodir bo'lmoqda?</h4>
        <p>
          Siz kiritgan har qanday 2 × 2 matritsa fazodagi barcha nuqtalarni yangi joyga ko'chiradi. 
          Bunda eng muhim qoida: <strong>to'g'ri chiziqlar to'g'riligicha qoladi va koordinatalar boshi (0, 0) o'z o'rnida qoladi</strong>.
          Rangli parallelogramm yuzi esa aynan <strong>Determinant</strong>ga teng! Agar det(A) = 0 bo'lsa, butun 2 o'lchamli tekislik bir zumda 1 o'lchamli chiziqqa qulab tushadi.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ================= 6. RIEMANN SUM SIMULATOR ================= -->
    <section id="panel-riemann-sum" class="sim-panel">
      <div class="sim-grid">
        <div class="canvas-card">
          <div class="canvas-header">
            <h3>⚡ Riman Integrali: Maydon qanday tug'iladi?</h3>
            <span class="live-tag">Egri chiziq osti yuzi</span>
          </div>
          <div class="canvas-wrapper">
            <canvas id="riemann-canvas" width="600" height="500"></canvas>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="controls-card">
          <div class="panel-section">
            <h4>Funksiyani tanlang:</h4>
            <div class="presets-wrap">
              <button class="preset-pill active" data-func="parabola">f(x) = x²</button>
              <button class="preset-pill" data-func="sin">f(x) = sin(x) + 1.2</button>
              <button class="preset-pill" data-func="gauss">f(x) = 3·e^(-x²)</button>
              <button class="preset-pill" data-func="poly">f(x) = x³ - 2x + 2</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="panel-section">
            <label class="control-label">
              <span>Bo'laklar soni (n ta to'rtburchak):</span>
              <strong id="riemann-n-display">10</strong>
            </label>
            <input type="range" id="riemann-n-slider" min="2" max="100" value="10" style="width: 100%;" />
          </div>

          <div class="panel-section">
            <h4>Approksimatsiya usuli:</h4>
            <div class="presets-wrap">
              <button class="preset-pill active" data-mode="mid">O'rta nuqta (Midpoint)</button>
              <button class="preset-pill" data-mode="left">Chap burchak (Left)</button>
              <button class="preset-pill" data-mode="right">O'ng burchak (Right)</button>
              <button class="preset-pill" data-mode="trap">Trapetsiyalar usuli</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="metrics-box">
            <div class="metric-row">
              <span>Aniq Integral (Nazariy):</span>
              <strong id="exact-integral-display">2.6667</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-row">
              <span>Riman Yig'indisi:</span>
              <strong id="approx-integral-display">2.6500</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-row">
              <span>Absolyut xatolik (Δ):</span>
              <span id="error-display" style="color: #f59e0b; font-weight: 700;">0.0167</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="theory-card">
        <h4>💡 Riman g'oyasi:</h4>
        <p>
          Egri chiziqli shaklning yuzini to'g'ridan-to'g'ri hisoblash qiyin. Riman ushbu yuzani juda mayda to'rtburchaklarga bo'lib chiqishni taklif qilgan. 
          To'rtburchaklar soni n → ∞ intilganda, ularning eni Δx → 0 bo'lib, yig'indi aniq integralga aylanadi:
          <strong>∫ f(x)dx = lim ∑ f(x_i) · Δx</strong>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ================= 7. MONTE CARLO PI SIMULATOR ================= -->
    <section id="panel-monte-carlo" class="sim-panel">
      <div class="sim-grid">
        <div class="canvas-card">
          <div class="canvas-header">
            <h3>🎯 Monte-Karlo: Ehtimollik orqali π ni topish</h3>
            <span class="live-tag">Tasodifiy o'qlar</span>
          </div>
          <div class="canvas-wrapper">
            <canvas id="monte-canvas" width="500" height="500"></canvas>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="controls-card">
          <div class="panel-section">
            <div style="display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
              <button id="btn-monte-start" class="btn btn-primary" style="flex: 1;">▶ Boshlash / To'xtatish</button>
              <button id="btn-monte-drop1000" class="btn btn-secondary">+1000 Nuqta</button>
              <button id="btn-monte-reset" class="btn btn-secondary">Tozalash</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="panel-section">
            <label class="control-label">
              <span>Simulyatsiya tezligi:</span>
              <strong id="monte-speed-display">50 nuqta/kadr</strong>
            </label>
            <input type="range" id="monte-speed-slider" min="5" max="200" value="50" style="width: 100%;" />
          </div>

          <div class="metrics-box">
            <div class="metric-row">
              <span>Jami tashlangan nuqtalar (N):</span>
              <strong id="monte-total">0</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-row">
              <span>Doira ichiga tushganlar (M):</span>
              <strong id="monte-inside" style="color: #10b981;">0</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-row" style="font-size: 1.15rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding-top: 0.5rem; margin-top: 0.5rem;">
              <span>Hisoblangan π ≈ 4 · (M / N):</span>
              <strong id="monte-pi-display" style="color: var(--primary);">0.00000</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-row">
              <span>Haqiqiy π qiymati:</span>
              <strong>3.14159</strong>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="theory-card">
        <h4>💡 Monte-Karlo mohiyati:</h4>
        <p>
          Doira yuzi S_doira = π R², uni o'rab turgan kvadrat yuzi S_kvadrat = 4R². 
          Ular maydonlarining nisbati aniq π / 4 ga teng. 
          Agar kvadratga tasodifiy nuqtalar yomg'irini yog'dirsangiz, doira ichiga tushgan nuqtalar ulushi ehtimollik bo'yicha aynan π / 4 ga intiladi!
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ================= 8. FOURIER EPICYCLES ================= -->
    <section id="panel-fourier-epicycles" class="sim-panel">
      <div class="sim-grid">
        <div class="canvas-card">
          <div class="canvas-header">
            <h3>🌊 Fure Epitsikllari: Aylanuvchi aylanalar to'lqini</h3>
