          <div class="metrics-box">
            <div class="metric-row">
              <span>Joriy qator yoyilmasi:</span>
              <span id="fourier-formula-display" style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.8rem;">y = 4/π (sin(t) + sin(3t)/3 + ...)</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="theory-card">
        <h4>💡 Jan Batist Fure kashfiyoti:</h4>
        <p>
          Fure isbotlaganki, har qanday davriy to'lqinni (hatto to'g'ri burchakli yoki arra shaklida bo'lsa ham) oddiy aylanma harakatlar — ya'ni <strong>sinus va kosinuslarning cheksiz yig'indisi</strong> ko'rinishida yozish mumkin.
          Har bir aylana ma'lum chastota va amplituda bilan aylanadi, ularning birgalikdagi harakati murakkab to'lqinni chizadi!
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ================= 9. GALTON BOARD ================= -->
    <section id="panel-galton-board" class="sim-panel">
      <div class="sim-grid">
        <div class="canvas-card">
          <div class="canvas-header">
